    "body": "## Summary\n- scope route quote reads and mode estimates to the authenticated owner\n- use an owner-scoped pessimistic lock for user-driven quote consumption while preserving the trusted internal settlement lock\n- cover read, estimate, and mutation enumeration paths and document the privacy boundary\n- update runtime smoke expectations to assert neutral `404` responses\n\n## Validation\n- `mvn -B -f apps/api/pom.xml verify`\n- `npm test`\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run build`\n- `bash -n .github/scripts/runtime-smoke.sh`\n- full container runtime smoke in GitHub Actions",
